### User Profile API Documentation
### Complete API documentation for user profile management endpoints
### Focused on profile update operations

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api
@contentType = application/json
@token = your-jwt-token-here
@userId = your-user-uuid-here
@fileId = your-file-uuid-here

### ============================================
### VARIABLES SETUP
### ============================================
### Replace the variables above with actual values:
### - @token: JWT token from /api/auth/verify-otp
### - @userId: UUID of an existing user
### - @fileId: UUID of a file uploaded via /api/s3/upload-url

### ============================================
### GET MY PROFILE
### ============================================
### Get the authenticated user's profile (requires authentication)
### Returns user with profilePictureData, skillsData, tagsData, and previousWorkData

GET {{baseUrl}}/users/me/profile
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Response Example:
### {
###   "success": true,
###   "message": "Profile fetched successfully",
###   "data": {
###     "id": "9d02af3a-f2b1-4d54-90a1-3cc322ec3bd1",
###     "name": "Mahmoud Nayel",
###     "phone": "+96601026597475",
###     "phoneVerification": true,
###     "country": "sa",
###     "address": null,
###     "overview": "Experienced developer",
###     "jobTitle": "Senior Developer",
###     "mode": "freelancer",
###     "isVerifiedAsFreelancer": false,
###     "isVerifiedAsClient": false,
###     "isSuspended": false,
###     "suspendedReason": null,
###     "available": true,
###     "avgRating": "4.50",
###     "totalReviews": 10,
###     "faceIdenbility": false,
###     "specificationId": "c94be4d5-b92f-4ba9-912d-1219b4c694c1",
###     "profilePicture": "file-uuid-here",
###     "profilePictureData": {
###       "id": "file-uuid-here",
###       "url": "https://ajwadi.s3.eu-west-3.amazonaws.com/profile/file-uuid-here-profile.jpg",
