### ============================================
### UPDATE MY PROFILE
### ============================================
### Update the authenticated user's profile (requires authentication)
### At least one field must be provided
### Skills and tags can be provided as arrays or comma-separated strings
### Profile picture requires file upload via /api/s3/upload-url first

### Update Complete Profile
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/me/profile
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "John Updated",
  "overview": "Updated overview with more details about my experience and skills",
  "jobTitle": "Lead Developer",
  "country": "CA",
  "address": "456 New St, Toronto",
  "specificationId": "c94be4d5-b92f-4ba9-912d-1219b4c694c1",
  "profilePicture": "{{fileId}}",
  "skills": ["skill-uuid-1", "skill-uuid-2", "skill-uuid-3"],
  "tags": ["tag-uuid-1", "tag-uuid-2"],
  "available": true
}

### Update Only Name
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/me/profile
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "John Updated"
}

### Update Only Overview
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/me/profile
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "overview": "Updated overview with more details about my experience"
}

### Update Only Job Title
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/me/profile
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "jobTitle": "Senior Full Stack Developer"
}

### Update Profile Picture
### Step 1: Upload file using /api/s3/upload-url with filePurpose: "profile"
### Example: POST /api/s3/upload-url
### {
###   "fileName": "profile.jpg",
###   "fileType": "image",
###   "filePurpose": "profile"
### }
### Step 2: Use the returned fileId as profilePicture value
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/me/profile
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "profilePicture": "{{fileId}}"
}

### Update Country and Address
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/me/profile
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "country": "US",
  "address": "123 Main St, New York, NY 10001"
}

### Update Specification
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/me/profile
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "specificationId": "c94be4d5-b92f-4ba9-912d-1219b4c694c1"
}

### Update Skills Only (Array Format)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/me/profile
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "skills": ["skill-uuid-1", "skill-uuid-2", "skill-uuid-3"]
}

### Update Skills Only (Comma-Separated Format)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/me/profile
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "skills": "skill-uuid-1,skill-uuid-2,skill-uuid-3"
}

### Update Tags Only (Array Format)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/me/profile
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "tags": ["tag-uuid-1", "tag-uuid-2"]
}

### Update Tags Only (Comma-Separated Format)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/me/profile
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "tags": "tag-uuid-1,tag-uuid-2"
}

### Update Skills and Tags Together
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/me/profile
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "skills": ["skill-uuid-1", "skill-uuid-2"],
  "tags": ["tag-uuid-1", "tag-uuid-2"]
}

### Update Availability Status
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/me/profile
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "available": false
}

### Update Multiple Fields Together
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/me/profile
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "John Updated",
  "overview": "Updated overview",
  "jobTitle": "Lead Developer",
  "country": "CA",
  "address": "456 New St",
  "specificationId": "c94be4d5-b92f-4ba9-912d-1219b4c694c1",
  "profilePicture": "{{fileId}}",
  "skills": ["skill-uuid-1", "skill-uuid-2"],
  "tags": ["tag-uuid-1"],
  "available": true
}

### Response Example (Success):
