### Error Response (Empty Payload):
### {
###   "success": false,
###   "message": "Validation error",
###   "errors": [
###     {
###       "field": "",
###       "message": "At least one field must be provided for update"
###     }
###   ]
### }

### Error Response (Invalid Name):
### {
###   "success": false,
###   "message": "Validation error",
###   "errors": [
###     {
###       "field": "name",
###       "message": "Name cannot be empty"
###     }
###   ]
### }

### Error Response (Unauthorized):
### {
###   "success": false,
###   "message": "Unauthorized"
### }

### ============================================
### UPDATABLE FIELDS
### ============================================
### The following fields can be updated:
### 
### - name: String (1-100 characters, optional)
### - overview: String (max 500 characters, optional, can be empty)
### - jobTitle: String (max 100 characters, optional, can be empty)
### - country: String (max 100 characters, optional, can be empty)
### - address: String (max 500 characters, optional, can be empty)
### - specificationId: UUID (optional, can be null)
### - profilePicture: UUID (optional, can be null, references FileHub)
### - skills: Array of UUIDs or comma-separated string (optional)
### - tags: Array of UUIDs or comma-separated string (optional)
### - available: Boolean (optional)
### 
### At least one field must be provided when updating

### ============================================
### PROFILE PICTURE UPLOAD WORKFLOW
### ============================================
### 
### Step 1: Get Upload URL
### POST {{baseUrl}}/s3/upload-url
### Content-Type: {{contentType}}
### Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
### 
### {
###   "fileName": "profile.jpg",
###   "fileType": "image",
###   "filePurpose": "profile"
### }
### 
### Response:
### {
###   "success": true,
###   "data": {
###     "uploadUrl": "https://ajwadi.s3.eu-west-3.amazonaws.com/...",
###     "file": {
###       "id": "file-uuid-here",
###       "fileName": "profile.jpg",
###       "fileType": "image",
###       "filePurpose": "profile",
###       ...
###     },
###     "uploadToken": "upload-token-here"
###   }
### }
### 
### Step 2: Upload File to S3
### PUT {uploadUrl from Step 1}
### Content-Type: image/jpeg
### 
### [Binary file data]
### 
### Step 3: Update Profile with File ID
### PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/me/profile
### Content-Type: {{contentType}}
### Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
### 
### {
###   "profilePicture": "file-uuid-here"
### }

### ============================================
### UPDATE AVAILABILITY STATUS (FREELANCER ONLY)
### ============================================
### Update availability status for freelancers
### Requires user JWT token
### Only freelancers can update their availability
### When available is false, clients cannot invite the freelancer to work

PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/me/availability
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "available": true
}

### Set freelancer as active (available for work)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/me/availability
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "available": true
}

### Set freelancer as inactive (not available for work)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/me/availability
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "available": false
}

### Request Body:
### - available: Boolean (required) - true for active, false for inactive

### Response Example (200 OK):
### {
###   "success": true,
###   "message": "Availability status updated to active successfully",
###   "data": {
###     "id": "user-uuid",
###     "available": true,
###     "mode": "freelancer"
###   }
### }

### Error Response (Not a Freelancer):
### {
###   "success": false,
###   "message": "Availability status can only be updated by freelancers"
### }

### Error Response (Missing Field):
### {
###   "success": false,
###   "message": "Validation error",
###   "errors": [
###     {
###       "field": "available",
###       "message": "Available status is required"
###     }
###   ]
### }

### ============================================
### NOTES & GUIDELINES
### ============================================
### 
### 1. AUTHENTICATION
###    - All endpoints require JWT token in Authorization header
###    - Format: Authorization: Bearer <token>
###    - Get token from: POST /api/auth/verify-otp
### 
### 2. PROFILE PICTURE
###    - Must be uploaded via /api/s3/upload-url first
###    - File purpose must be "profile"
###    - Use the fileId from upload response
###    - profilePictureData is automatically included in responses
###    - Includes fileExtension field for easy file type detection
### 
### 3. SKILLS AND TAGS
###    - Can be provided as arrays: ["uuid1", "uuid2"]
###    - Can be provided as comma-separated: "uuid1,uuid2"
###    - Can be provided as JSON string: "[\"uuid1\", \"uuid2\"]"
###    - Skills reference the Skills table
###    - Tags reference the Tags table
### 
### 4. RESPONSE DATA
###    - profilePictureData: Full file object with url, fileName, fileExtension, etc.
###    - skillsData: Array of skill objects with id, name, specificationId
###    - tagsData: Array of tag objects with id, name, badgeUrl
###    - previousWork: Array of previous work objects
### 
### 5. VALIDATION
###    - At least one field must be provided
###    - Name must be 1-100 characters if provided
###    - Overview must be max 500 characters if provided
###    - Job title must be max 100 characters if provided
###    - Country must be max 100 characters if provided
###    - Address must be max 500 characters if provided
### 
### 6. ERROR HANDLING
###    - 400 Bad Request: Validation errors
###    - 401 Unauthorized: Missing or invalid token
###    - 404 Not Found: User not found
###    - 500 Internal Server Error: Server error
